<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 13.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 13.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Friday, June 13:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,677.30 (1,670.40)	CHF  1,160.90 (1,162.40)</p>
<p>    DEM    972.91 (973.99)	  GBP  2,737.90 (2,732.10)</p>
<p>    ATS    138.33 (138.40)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Thursday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $15.84 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$ 9.40 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $25.24 million ($48.47 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
</text>
